OL,3,GNEWSAHow a prolific shoplifter's life
OL,4,Awas turned around
OL,5,
OL,6,FShoplifting was once a way of life for
OL,7,FPhil.
OL,9,FAs a prolific thief operating in the
OL,10,FWest Midlands, he would snatch goods
OL,11,Fdaily to fuel a drugs habit. "I was on
OL,12,Fheroin, I had a crack cocaine
OL,13,Faddiction," he said. "Every day was a
OL,14,Fgamble... the only way to cope was to
OL,15,Fshoplift."
OL,17,FHe has since turned around his life,
OL,18,Fsharing with the BBC how he achieved
OL,19,Fthe breakthrough.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
