OL,3,GNEWSAHow a prolific shoplifter's life
OL,4,Awas turned around
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as new figures from the BBC
OL,7,FData Unit show tens of thousands of
OL,8,Fshoplifting offences every year are
OL,9,Fcarried out by relatively few people.
